{% if category_top_targets -%}
Lifting {{ category_top_targets|join(', ') }} to the {{ category_benchmark|fmt('.1f') }}% average adds ~{{ category_top3_at_stake|fmt(',') }} carting sessions; at today's {{ (cart_to_purchase * 100)|fmt('.1f') }}% cart → purchase rate, ~{{ cat_orders|fmt(',') }} orders: <strong>${{ cat_revenue_low|fmt(',.0f') }}–${{ cat_revenue|fmt(',.0f') }}</strong> (upper end: every added cart behaves like today's carts).
{%- else -%}
No page-level target, so no page-level sizing.
{%- endif %}
